    <item>
      <title>Problema com Zabbix &#43; Curl 7.87.0 no Slackware 15 e Current</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/problema-com-zabbix-curl-7-87-0-no-slackware-15-e-current/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 05 Jan 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/problema-com-zabbix-curl-7-87-0-no-slackware-15-e-current/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hoje quando fui atualizar o meu &lt;strong&gt;Zabbix Server&lt;/strong&gt; para a versão &lt;strong&gt;6.0.12&lt;/strong&gt; recebi um erro na hora de criar o pacote para o &lt;strong&gt;Slackware&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/problema-com-zabbix-curl-7-87-0-no-slackware-15-e-current/images/2023-01-05_11-21.png&#34; &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;1024&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;518&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/problema-com-zabbix-curl-7-87-0-no-slackware-15-e-current/images/2023-01-05_11-21-1024x518_hu_5a06037d0d1d6ed9.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/problema-com-zabbix-curl-7-87-0-no-slackware-15-e-current/images/2023-01-05_11-21-1024x518_hu_5a06037d0d1d6ed9.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/problema-com-zabbix-curl-7-87-0-no-slackware-15-e-current/images/2023-01-05_11-21-1024x518.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/problema-com-zabbix-curl-7-87-0-no-slackware-15-e-current/images/2023-01-05_11-21-1024x518.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;Pesquisando um pouco sobre o problema, já cai na página de suporte da Zabbix.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Descobrindo seu IP REAL pelo Terminal</title>
